<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Projects on CHIPS Alliance</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/</link><description>Recent content in Projects on CHIPS Alliance</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Caliptra</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/caliptra/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/caliptra/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ip-and-firmware-for-an-integrated-root-of-trust-block">IP and firmware for an integrated Root of Trust block&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Caliptra targets datacenter-class SoCs such as CPUs, GPUs, DPUs, and TPUs. It includes the specification, silicon logic, ROM, and firmware for implementing a Root of Trust for Measurement (RTM) block inside an SoC. A Caliptra integration provides the SoC with Identity, Measured Boot, and Attestation capabilities.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="get-involved">Get Involved&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Caliptra meetings are held every Thursday at 1 p.m. PT. Meeting invitations and agendas are shared through the Caliptra mailing list.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Chisel</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/chisel/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/chisel/</guid><description/></item><item><title>F4PGA</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/f4pga/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/f4pga/</guid><description/></item><item><title>FPGA Interchange format</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/fpga-interchange-format/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/fpga-interchange-format/</guid><description/></item><item><title>FPGA tool perf</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/fpga-tool-perf/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/fpga-tool-perf/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Intel Compiler for SystemC</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/systemc-compiler/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/systemc-compiler/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenPRoT</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/openprot/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/openprot/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Surelog and UHDM</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/surelog-uhdm/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/242/projects/surelog-uhdm/</guid><description/></item><item><title>SV tools</title><link>https://chipsalliance.org/preview/